OL,3,GNEWSASenedd member who quit Reform says
OL,4,Aparty is 'falling apart' and she would
OL,5,Aback independence
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer defection - which came on the same
OL,8,Fday Dan Thomas stepped down as Reform's
OL,9,FWelsh leader - means Plaid has 44
OL,10,Fmembers in Cardiff Bay, and Reform as
OL,11,Fthe largest opposition party has 33
OL,12,Fseats.
